# Customer Churn Prediction

## Live Demo

🔗 [Try the Customer Churn Prediction App](https://customer-churn-prediction-ido8cswunbdz6usubiutrz.streamlit.app)

A machine learning classification project that predicts whether a telecom customer is likely to churn based on customer account, service, and billing information.

## Project Objective

The goal of this project is to build and evaluate machine learning models for customer churn prediction and deploy the final model through a simple Streamlit web application.

## Dataset

The project uses the Telco Customer Churn dataset.

The dataset contains customer information such as:

- Gender
- Senior Citizen status
- Tenure
- Internet service
- Contract type
- Payment method
- Monthly charges
- Total charges
- Churn status

