## Models Tested

The following classification models were evaluated:

- Logistic Regression
- Decision Tree
- Random Forest
- Gradient Boosting

## Model Results

| Model | Accuracy | Precision | Recall | F1 Score | ROC-AUC |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| Logistic Regression | 80.4% | 64.8% | 57.2% | 60.8% | 83.6% |
| Decision Tree | 73.6% | 50.3% | 51.1% | 50.7% | 66.3% |
| Random Forest | 78.3% | 61.9% | 47.9% | 54.0% | 81.3% |
| Gradient Boosting | 79.7% | 64.3% | 52.9% | 58.1% | 83.9% |

## Final Model

Logistic Regression was selected as the final model.

The tuned Logistic Regression achieved approximately:

- Accuracy: 80.0%
- Precision: 64.0%
- Recall: 57.0%
- F1 Score: 60.3%
- ROC-AUC: 83.5%

Although Gradient Boosting achieved a slightly higher ROC-AUC, Logistic Regression achieved better recall and F1-score on the test set.

